@@ -0,0 +1,138 @@
+////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+//
+// SFML - Simple and Fast Multimedia Library
+// Copyright (C) 2007-2011 Marco Antognini (antognini.marco@gmail.com), 
+//                         Laurent Gomila (laurent.gom@gmail.com), 
